Cyberpunk style: A towering futuristic cityscape at night where buildings are constructed from glowing, stacked code blocks and circuit patterns in neon orange and teal. In the foreground, a sleek robotic coffee cup mascot with steam rising from it stands on a floating platform, its body composed of modular geometric segments that click together like building blocks. Multiple translucent holographic layers float between skyscrapers showing abstract data streams and geometric patterns flowing upward. The atmosphere is electric with rain reflecting colorful lights on wet surfaces, chrome pipes, and exposed machinery. Small flying drones shaped like coffee beans zip between structures. The entire scene conveys rapid evolution and technological progression, with older darker structures in the background giving way to increasingly bright, sophisticated architecture toward the horizon.
